      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Old_Washington%2C_Ohio",
      "category": "transport",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "During Morgan's Raid in July 1863, Old Washington saw a brief skirmish, and three Confederate soldiers are buried in its cemetery.",
